***************************************************************************
* Supervisory file for SOCSIM microsimulation for Sweden, 1950-2100
* Modified on 02.04.2026
***************************************************************************
* This simulation uses as input age-specific fertility rates and
* age-specific probabilities of death (qx)  
* retrieved from the World Population Prospects 2024 
* converted into SOCSIM format.
***************************************************************************

segments  152
input_file presim

marriage_after_childbirth 1 
marriage_eval distribution
marriage_queues 1
hetfert 0
bint 12

***********************************************************************
* Pre-simulation (200 years) using WPP rates for 1950
* to get stable population at 31-12-1949
* with complete kinship networks for individuals across all ages 0-100

duration 2400
include rates/SWEfert1950
include rates/SWEmort1950
run


* First simulation with actual fertility and mortality rates. 
* Give population at 31-12-1950

duration 12
include rates/SWEfert1950
include rates/SWEmort1950
run

